{20}{My name is Sarah Toone. Pleased to make your acquaintance.}{My name is Sarah Toone. Pleased to make your acquaintance.}{}{}{}{ }
{21}{Likewise, I'm sure. Are you the daughter of Bessie?}{}{5}{}{30}{ }
{30}{[She suddenly looks very sad.] Yes, yes I am. Why do you ask?}{[She suddenly looks very sad.] Yes, yes I am. Why do you ask?}{}{}{}{ }
{31}{I am trying to find a way to free your mother's ghost.}{}{5}{}{40}{ }
{40}{Oh? And why, may I ask, are you doing that?}{Oh? And why, may I ask, are you doing that?}{}{}{}{ }
{41}{Your brother is rather upset, understandably. I offered to help.}{}{5}{}{50}{ }
{50}{My brother? Upset? Why? He should be happy, the dog! He got what he wanted, after all.}{My brother? Upset? Why? He should be happy, the dog! He got what he wanted, after all.}{}{}{}{ }
{51}{He told me you didn't like him.}{}{5}{}{60}{ }
{52}{Your mother's ghost has "soured" the ore, and he fears for his life.}{}{5}{}{70}{ }
{60}{"Not like him"? That is an understatement. Do you know what he did? He convinced my mother to sign the mine over to him, and then he sold it to those thugs in Tarant! She killed herself over that!}{"Not like him"? That is an understatement. Do you know what he did? He convinced my mother to sign the mine over to him, and then he sold it to those thugs in Tarant! She killed herself over that!}{}{}{}{ }
{61}{How did he convince her to sign?}{}{5}{}{90}{ }
{62}{Why did she kill herself over the mine?}{}{5}{}{100}{ }
{70}{Pardon me while I shed a tear for my "dear" brother. As I said, he is getting what he deserves.}{Pardon me while I shed a tear for my "dear" brother. As I said, he is getting what he deserves.}{}{}{}{ }
{71}{Why are you so hostile towards him?}{}{5}{}{80}{ }
{80}{"Hostile towards him"? That is an understatement. Do you know what he did? He convinced my mother to sign the mine over to him, and then he sold it to those thugs in Tarant! She killed herself over that!}{"Hostile towards him"? That is an understatement. Do you know what he did? He convinced my mother to sign the mine over to him, and then he sold it to those thugs in Tarant! She killed herself over that!}{}{}{}{ }
{81}{How did he convince her to sign?}{}{5}{}{90}{ }
{82}{Why did she kill herself over the mine?}{}{5}{}{100}{ }
{90}{She always wanted me to run it, as my brother was notorious for bungling things. He convinced her that "for legal reasons" it should be in his name as she was getting old, and I was not yet of legal age. She resisted at first, but my brother always was able to wear her down. He was insidious in that way.}{She always wanted me to run it, as my brother was notorious for bungling things. He convinced her that "for legal reasons" it should be in his name as she was getting old, and I was not yet of legal age. She resisted at first, but my brother always was able to wear her down. He was insidious in that way.}{}{}{}{ }
{91}{But why did she kill herself over him selling it?}{}{5}{}{100}{ }
{92}{Did you know she's calling your name? Why is that?}{}{5}{}{280}{ }
{100}{Her only wish was that the mine stay in our family, as it had been for more than three generations. It was our heritage. She often told me that she would rather be dead than to have anyone else but a Toone run it.}{Her only wish was that the mine stay in our family, as it had been for more than three generations. It was our heritage. She often told me that she would rather be dead than to have anyone else but a Toone run it.}{}{}{}{ru2206 }
{101}{Can you tell me who owns your family's mine now?}{}{5}{}{110}{ }
{102}{Did you know she's calling your name? Why is that?}{}{5}{}{280}{ }
