{200}{I knew what my brother was going to do as soon as he "stole" the mine from me and my mother. I couldn't bear to watch. I tried to get my mother to come with me, but she wouldn't leave her home. I moved here because I had nothing...I don't even own this place, it was deserted.}{I knew what my brother was going to do as soon as he "stole" the mine from me and my mother. I couldn't bear to watch. I tried to get my mother to come with me, but she wouldn't leave her home. I moved here because I had nothing...I don't even own this place, it was deserted.}{}{}{}{ }
