{220}{Oh thank you, this is great news! I can't thank you enough. [She looks at the deed for a moment, and then suddenly seems to remember something.] Wait - there is something I can give you. I don't think it's worth much of anything, I have never had it identified, but I know it is at least magickal...[she hands you a sword].}{Oh thank you, this is great news! I can't thank you enough. [She looks at the deed for a moment, and then suddenly seems to remember something.] Wait - there is something I can give you. I don't think it's worth much of anything, I have never had it identified, but I know it is at least magickal...[she hands you a sword].}{}{}{}{xp1, qu1163 4 }
